<h1>William Hall</h1>
<p>6th Ward alderman, on the Chicago ballot February 23, 2027. Incumbent.</p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Filed nominating petitions for reelection; on the Chicago Board of Elections candidate list as of Oct. 30, 2026. No 2027 campaign website or platform found. When he took office in 2023 he said he would work on public safety, economic opportunity, equitable city services, and neighborhood schools.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>6th Ward alderman since 2023; before that, senior pastor of St. James Community Church in Chatham.</p>
